OL,3,GNEWSAHotelier and sister cleared of    
OL,4,Amother's morphine murder               
OL,6,FA well-known Oxford hotelier and his   
OL,7,Fsister have been cleared of murdering  
OL,8,Ftheir 100-year-old mother by giving her
OL,9,Fmorphine to speed up her death.        
OL,11,FThe Crown Prosecution Service (CPS)    
OL,12,Fsaid it would no longer seek a         
OL,13,Fconviction for murder against Jeremy   
OL,14,FMogford, 79, and Sarah Pickering, 72.  
OL,16,FToxicologists previously told Oxford   
OL,17,FCrown Court it was "not possible" to   
OL,18,Fconclude Pamela Mogford's death on 15  
OL,19,FFebruary 2022 was "caused by excess    
OL,20,Fmorphine".                             
